 oware:['Boards','CPU or local 2-player','OWARE — ABAPA','Sow from a house on your side. Feed an empty opponent; captures cannot empty the opposing side. First to 25 seeds wins. Computer opponent by default; choose local two-player in settings. Threefold repetition is a digital end convention.'],
